.TH "PACE GEAR" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace gear Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-gear \- Gear inventory and usage.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace gear
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Gear inventory and usage.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlist\fP
  List all gear items.
  See \fBpace gear-list(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlist\fP command.
.PP
\fBstats\fP
  Wear stats for a gear item.
  See \fBpace gear-stats(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBstats\fP command.
.PP
\fBdefaults\fP
  Default gear assignments per activity type.
  See \fBpace gear-defaults(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBdefaults\fP command.
